#! ia 1.0

@schema repository
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have repository
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    may have meaning.answers as text
    must have repository.url as text "Canonical Git repository URL or locator, never carrying embedded credentials."
    may have repository.profile as text "Identifier or locator of the structural layer profile this repository follows."
    may have repository.organisation as text "Identity of the organisation workspace when this repository belongs to an organisation."
    may have repository.knowledge-base as text "Single canonical organisation knowledge-base repository locator or identity; repository visibility is read from the Git host rather than duplicated here."
